# Role-tiering on Cursor child spawn

Before spawning a worker, verifier, or planner, Read `CURSOR.md` at the
workspace root and follow it. That file owns how this host sets `Task.model`.
Do not copy the rule elsewhere. Do not import
`.context-circuit/wrapper/adapters/CURSOR.md` — Read workspace-root `CURSOR.md`.
